<SceneText>
  <Speakers>
    <Section>Speaker</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>42400,42736,42900,43224,43416</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Suzu&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Suzu&gt;</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>42476,42624,42828,43012,43132,43332,43484,43572</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Rondoline&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Rondoline&gt;</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Speakers>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>42404</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_069_001&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Rody&gt;さんと旅するのは
ダオス戦役ぶりですね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We haven't traveled together
since Dhaos's War, &lt;Rody&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>42480</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_069_002&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>え？　……ああ、そうだね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eh? Oh... Yeah,
you're right.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>42628</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_069_003&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>私ってばついさっき、その時代から来たばっかで、
&lt;Suzu&gt;ちゃんともひさしぶりって感じしないんだよね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But I came straight from then, so it
doesn't feel like a long time to me, &lt;Suzu&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>42740</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_069_004&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そうなのですね。
でも、こちらの時代ではもう半年になります</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah, that makes sense. But it's already
been half a year since then, for me.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>42832</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_069_005&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>半年か……
私の時間は半年さえも進まない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Half a year, already... It's like time
just never moves forward, for me.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>42904</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_069_006&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>どういうことですか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>How do you mean?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>43016</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_069_007&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ダオスを追いかけ始めてから、
ずっと私の時間は止まってるんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>"My" time has been stopped ever
since I decided to go after Dhaos.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>43136</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_069_008&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>３００年近い時間の帯を行き来してるのに、
時間はずっと止まったまま</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I've been traveling back and forth across a span of
300 years, but for me, time has been at a dead stop.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>43228</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_069_009&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Rody&gt;さんはどうしてそうまでして……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Why would you go
that far, &lt;Rody&gt;...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>43336</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_069_010&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ダオスを倒すのか？
……その質問されるの、もう何回目かな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>To defeat Dhaos? ...I wonder how many
times I've been asked that same question.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>43420</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_069_011&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……みんな知りたいんだと思います</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...I think everyone just
genuinely wants to know.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>43488</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_069_012&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そうかもね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Maybe so...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>43576</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_069_013&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>私も知りたいよ、この衝動の理由……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I want to know, too. What it is that
motivates me, to do all of this...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Notice</Section>
  </Strings>
</SceneText>
